WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.187
AFTER RAIN. A shallow puddle lies on a sunny path.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.653
LATER. The outline of the puddle is smaller.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.507
EXPLAIN. Some water evaporates into invisible vapour.

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:15.481
ALSO. Some water may soak into soil or flow away.
